# decodelabs project 2 Grade Calculator 

A Java console application that calculates a student's total marks, average percentage, and final grade based on marks entered for multiple subjects.

Features

- Accepts marks for multiple subjects
- Validates marks between 0 and 100
- Calculates total marks
- Calculates average percentage
- Assigns a grade from A to F
- Displays a student report

Grade Criteria

Average| Grade
90–100| A
80–89| B
70–79| C
60–69| D
Below 60| F

Concepts Used

- Java Scanner
- Loops
- Arithmetic operations
- If-else conditions
- Type casting
- Input validation